      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.43,
      "end_seconds": 69.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.74,
      "end_seconds": 93.13,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.66,
      "end_seconds": 96.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "I've got high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.11,
      "end_seconds": 109.98,
      "duration_seconds": 11.87,
      "text": "Right, so high cholesterol is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.29,
      "end_seconds": 116.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "So, I take rosuvastatin, at night for my cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.46,
      "end_seconds": 120.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.6,
      "end_seconds": 124.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "It's 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.05,
      "end_seconds": 135.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.88,
      "end_seconds": 148.23,
      "duration_seconds": 10.35,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.78,
      "end_seconds": 154.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.75,
      "end_seconds": 156.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.27,
      "end_seconds": 161.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "And what about rash or sores?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.04,
      "end_seconds": 165.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "None of those, uh, no."
