      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.03,
      "end_seconds": 214.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.55,
      "end_seconds": 243.66,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 117 over 69, SpO2 99 percent on room air. And temp 36.7 degrees, pulse 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.72,
      "end_seconds": 246.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.2,
      "end_seconds": 249.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.46,
      "end_seconds": 256.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.89,
      "end_seconds": 259.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "nearly finished here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.81,
      "end_seconds": 274.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "there are no visible sores or discharge"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.7,
      "end_seconds": 294.48,
      "duration_seconds": 14.78,
      "text": "Okay, good, you can sit up again. Putting it all together, it points towards a routine screen with no symptoms. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.93,
      "end_seconds": 345.47,
      "duration_seconds": 35.54,
      "text": "let's get blood tests for HIV and syphilis, for sexual health screen. I'd like to arrange a urine test for chlamydia and gonorrhoea for sexual health screen. Use condoms with new partners and we will text the results. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.49,
      "end_seconds": 353.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "please come and see me after the results anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.0,
      "end_seconds": 358.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.51,
      "end_seconds": 361.19,
